  "body_html": "<h1>Algebraic Groups and Homogeneous Spaces</h1>\n<p>This topic contains the group-theoretic and homogeneous-space foundations of\nthe Langlands program.</p>\n<p>It includes the Borel-Tits-Bruhat-Tits line of algebraic group theory,\nroot-theoretic and Coxeter-theoretic combinatorics, rational forms, dual groups,\nBrylinski-Deligne and metaplectic covers, buildings, Kottwitz structures,\nrefined inner twists, and homogeneous or spherical spaces.</p>",
